WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.103 --> 00:00:04.003
ODIN
Do you swear to guard the Nine Realms?

00:00:04.548 --> 00:00:05.577
THOR
I swear.

00:00:05.627 --> 00:00:08.990
ODIN
And do you swear to preserve the peace?

00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:10.160
THOR
I swear.

00:00:10.595 --> 00:00:12.379
KEVIN FEIGE
One of the early decisions we made

00:00:12.429 --> 00:00:16.839
at Marvel Studios was bringing on Thor.
And we always knew we wanted to find

00:00:16.889 --> 00:00:22.996
an amazing performer who had the chops
to perform this character as we saw him.

00:00:24.527 --> 00:00:27.983
We looked the world over,
and we found Chris Hemsworth.

00:00:28.623 --> 00:00:30.340
CHRIS HEMSWORTH
This world is my punishment.

00:00:31.932 --> 00:00:34.969
It's my punishment for
my endless pursuit of glory.

00:00:35.019 --> 00:00:36.303
KEVIN FEIGE
The way Chris did it, we thought,

00:00:36.353 --> 00:00:37.647
"Okay, this is gonna work."

00:00:41.039 --> 00:00:42.783
NATALIE PORTMAN
It's really, really just impressive to

00:00:42.833 --> 00:00:46.942
watch him work. He's so committed
and works so hard. He has such incredible

00:00:46.992 --> 00:00:48.187
comedic talent as well.

00:00:49.571 --> 00:00:51.286
THOR
This drink, I like it. Another!

00:00:52.787 --> 00:00:54.111
Is that the best you can do?

00:00:55.520 --> 00:00:57.523
ANNOUNCER
Chris Hemsworth as Thor!

00:00:58.171 --> 00:00:59.652
CHRIS HEMSWORTH
This is what it's all about, you know,

00:00:59.702 --> 00:01:03.787
 is coming, meeting the people who love
the characters more than anyone

00:01:03.837 --> 00:01:06.051
and so that's a very,
very special thing.

00:01:08.981 --> 00:01:09.838
[Laughing]

00:01:10.639 --> 00:01:12.264
TESSA THOMPSON
It really is inspiring because he is

00:01:12.314 --> 00:01:14.979
brave enough to
try things and see what sticks.

00:01:16.667 --> 00:01:18.292
TAIKA WAITITI
When I came on to do Ragnarok,

00:01:18.342 --> 00:01:21.616
I basically just said, "Look, man,
you just got to be more of yourself."

00:01:21.667 --> 00:01:24.427
"It would make the
character more relatable and funny."

00:01:24.477 --> 00:01:25.538
THOR
I swear I'm not even moving,

00:01:25.588 --> 00:01:26.773
it's just doing this on its own.

00:01:26.823 --> 00:01:27.600
TAIKA WAITITI
I think that's what you want

00:01:27.651 --> 00:01:28.204
in a Super Hero.

00:01:28.254 --> 00:01:29.749
THOR
Yes!

00:01:29.800 --> 00:01:31.900
CHRIS HEMSWORTH
I have loved every single time I've

00:01:31.950 --> 00:01:34.817
played the character.
This is ten years now.

00:01:34.887 --> 00:01:37.646
To have the opportunity to do another one
is just mind blowing. You know?

00:01:37.696 --> 00:01:38.851
It's gonna be incredible.

00:01:39.085 --> 00:01:40.737
THOR
What a classic Thor adventure!

00:01:44.538 --> 00:01:45.575
ZEUS
And flick!

00:01:45.626 --> 00:01:47.310
[Crowd gasping]

00:01:47.619 --> 00:01:48.222
KORG
Oh.

00:01:48.273 --> 00:01:49.840
THOR
You flicked too hard, damn it!

